description:
Create or safely reuse a complete multi-layer variable foundation in one call. The handler validates request structure before writing, then creates collections, primitive variables, and semantic aliases in dependency order while resolving local keys to real Figma IDs. Conflicts discovered against existing Figma content stop the operation. Later failures trigger best-effort rollback of newly created artifacts; any retained IDs or rollback errors are reported explicitly.

Use only when the user supplied all of the following:

- every collection name and complete ordered mode list;
- every primitive variable name, type, collection, and value for every mode in that collection;
- every semantic alias name, type, collection, and primitive target for every mode in that collection.

One call accepts at most 10 collections and 50 total primitives plus aliases. Split a larger foundation into independent complete calls.

`key` and `collection` are local references within this call, not Figma IDs. `values_by_mode` and `targets_by_mode` keys must exactly match the modes of their referenced collection. Every alias target must be a primitive key in this call with the same type. A same-name collection with incompatible modes is rejected instead of creating a duplicate.

Do not use for binding existing nodes, switching modes, adding or renaming a mode on an existing collection, partial token specifications, or aliases that target pre-existing variables. Use the focused variable tools for those operations.

Example:

```json
{
  "collections": [
    { "key": "raw", "name": "Primitives", "modes": ["Value"] },
    { "key": "semantic", "name": "Semantic", "modes": ["Light", "Dark"] }
  ],
  "primitives": [
    {
      "key": "brand-blue",
      "collection": "raw",
      "name": "Brand/Blue",
      "type": "COLOR",
      "values_by_mode": { "Value": "#335CFF" }
    },
    {
      "key": "space-8",
      "collection": "raw",
      "name": "Space/8",
      "type": "FLOAT",
      "values_by_mode": { "Value": 8 }
    }
  ],
  "aliases": [
    {
      "key": "color-action",
      "collection": "semantic",
      "name": "Color/Action",
      "type": "COLOR",
      "targets_by_mode": { "Light": "brand-blue", "Dark": "brand-blue" }
    },
    {
      "key": "space-control",
      "collection": "semantic",
      "name": "Space/Control",
      "type": "FLOAT",
      "targets_by_mode": { "Light": "space-8", "Dark": "space-8" }
    }
  ]
}
```
